  "story": {
    "day": 161,
    "title": "Kaya's Shopping Trip",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya arrived home from school at 3 p.m.",
      "She had played dodge ball on the playground earlier.",
      "Then Kaya walked to the shop with her mother.",
      "They needed many ingredients for dinner.",
      "They bought a big potato, red tomatoes, and yellow corn.",
      "Fresh carrots, green cabbage, and brown mushrooms were also in the basket.",
      "Her mother chose some chicken. \"This seasoning is important,\" she said.",
      "Kaya saw a toy horse, a cute koala, and a striped zebra.",
      "A dolphin and an octopus were on a poster nearby.",
      "Kaya bought a bright yellow lemon.",
      "She was not scared; she hoped to go skiing soon.",
      "Kaya spent a good hour at the shop."
    ]
  }
}